108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (Organizations handle a large number of business documents such as contracts, policies, reports, invoices, and agreements. Manually reviewing these documents for potential risks and compliance issues is time-consuming and may result in important information being overlooked.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (The AI Document Risk & Compliance Classifier is an Artificial Intelligence and Natural Language Processing based system designed to automatically analyze documents and classify them according to their risk and compliance level. The system extracts text from uploaded documents, preprocesses the content, identifies important terms and patterns, and applies machine learning techniques to determine whether a document belongs to a low, medium, or high-risk category.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (The system also provides a confidence score for each prediction and sends uncertain documents for manual verification. Important terms and relevant document sections can be highlighted to improve explainability. An interactive dashboard displays document classifications, risk levels, flagged documents, and overall analytics. This system helps reduce manual effort, improve consistency, and support faster and more effective document review.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
