129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Organizations process a large number of documents that may contain contractual obligations, sensitive information, compliance requirements, and potential business risks. Manually reviewing every document requires significant time and effort and may lead to inconsistent decisions or missed risk indicators.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Traditional document management systems mainly focus on storing, searching, and retrieving documents rather than intelligently identifying potential risks and compliance concerns. In addition, uncertain documents may not be automatically separated for detailed human review.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Therefore, there is a need for an AI-based document classification system that can automatically analyze document content, identify potential risk and compliance categories, provide confidence levels, highlight important information, and send uncertain cases for manual verification.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
