/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (First, the uploaded document is processed using text extraction techniques. Unnecessary formatting and irrelevant content are removed during preprocessing. The cleaned text is then converted into machine-readable features using techniques such as TF-IDF or text embeddings.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (A machine learning or NLP-based classifier analyzes these features and assigns the document to an appropriate risk category such as Low Risk, Medium Risk, or High Risk. The system can also identify compliance-related keywords and important sections.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
