<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (The AI Document Risk & Compliance Classifier provides an intelligent approach for automatically analyzing and categorizing business documents based on potential risk and compliance characteristics. By combining Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, and Machine Learning, the system reduces the effort required for initial document review.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (The use of confidence scoring, explainability, validation, and manual review makes the system more useful and reliable by ensuring that uncertain predictions can be examined by human reviewers. The interactive dashboard provides a clear overview of document classifications and risk patterns.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (Overall, the proposed system can help organizations save time, improve document review consistency, identify potential risks earlier, and support better compliance management. With future enhancements such as OCR, multilingual NLP, advanced AI models, and enterprise integration, the system can become a more powerful document risk-management solution.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
